# Keys are pasted in the in-app Settings drawer.
# The Vite proxy must not read GROQ_API_KEY or OMNIROUTE_API_KEY from the environment.
#
# Live tests (`npm run test:live`) DO require these in the test-runner env:
#   GROQ_API_KEY
#   OMNIROUTE_API_KEY
#   OMNIROUTE_URL          # optional; default http://localhost:20128
